- propose_delete_character: Prepare moving a character to Recently Deleted. (prepares a proposal for the user to review) Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"character":{"description":"id from an earlier result, or the exact name","maxLength":200,"type":"string"}},"required":["character"],"type":"object"}
