- propose_moodboard: Prepare a new moodboard (optionally for a scene). (prepares a proposal for the user to review) Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"name":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"sceneNumber":{"maximum":100000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["name"],"type":"object"}
- propose_moodboard_note: Prepare a text note on a moodboard. (prepares a proposal for the user to review) Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"moodboard":{"description":"id from an earlier result, or the exact name","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"private":{"type":"boolean"},"text":{"maxLength":4000,"type":"string"}},"required":["moodboard","text"],"type":"object"}
- moodboards: Moodboards, or one moodboard's notes, images, links and captions. Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"moodboard":{"description":"id from an earlier result, or the exact name","maxLength":200,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"}
- propose_moodboard_vault_image: Prepare placing an Idea Vault image on a moodboard. (prepares a proposal for the user to review) Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"moodboard":{"description":"id from an earlier result, or the exact name","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"vaultItem":{"description":"id from an earlier result, or the exact name","maxLength":200,"type":"string"}},"required":["moodboard","vaultItem"],"type":"object"}
- propose_update_moodboard: Prepare renaming a moodboard or editing its notes. (prepares a proposal for the user to review) Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"moodboard":{"description":"id from an earlier result, or the exact name","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"name":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"notes":{"maxLength":4000,"type":"string"}},"required":["moodboard"],"type":"object"}
- propose_delete_moodboard: Prepare moving a moodboard to Recently Deleted. (prepares a proposal for the user to review) Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"moodboard":{"description":"id from an earlier result, or the exact name","maxLength":200,"type":"string"}},"required":["moodboard"],"type":"object"}
- propose_update_moodboard_item: Prepare edits to a moodboard item's caption, note text or link. (prepares a proposal for the user to review) Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"caption":{"maxLength":1000,"type":"string"},"item":{"description":"id from an earlier result, or the exact name","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"linkTitle":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"moodboard":{"description":"id from an earlier result, or the exact name","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"text":{"maxLength":4000,"type":"string"},"url":{"maxLength":2000,"type":"string"}},"required":["moodboard","item"],"type":"object"}
- propose_delete_moodboard_items: Prepare moving moodboard items to Recently Deleted. (prepares a proposal for the user to review) Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"items":{"items":{"description":"id from an earlier result, or the exact name","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"maxItems":50,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"moodboard":{"description":"id from an earlier result, or the exact name","maxLength":200,"type":"string"}},"required":["moodboard","items"],"type":"object"}
- propose_moodboard_link: Prepare a web link on a moodboard. (prepares a proposal for the user to review) Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"moodboard":{"description":"id from an earlier result, or the exact name","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"title":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"url":{"maxLength":2000,"type":"string"}},"required":["moodboard","url"],"type":"object"}
- location_statistics: Distinct screenplay locations, interior/exterior and day/night counts, plus Location records. Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"draft":{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"}
- scene_fact: One fact about a numbered screenplay scene, read from its full text: summary, who speaks, how many speak, where, day or night, first or last line, first dialogue, or whether it mentions something. Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"draft":{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"},"fact":{"enum":["summary","speakers","speaker_count","setting","time","first_line","last_line","first_dialogue","mentions"],"type":"string"},"scene":{"maximum":100000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"text":{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"}},"required":["scene","fact"],"type":"object"}
- project_settings: Project settings (title, type, status, logline, genre, language, creator) and the people on the project with their roles. Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{},"type":"object"}
- recent_activity: Recent project activity: who changed what, and when. Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"limit":{"maximum":50,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"type":"object"}
- project_files: Project Files: folders and files with their notes (optionally one folder). Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"folder":{"description":"id from an earlier result, or the exact name","maxLength":200,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"}
- final_answer: Finish with a short answer written only from the tool results above. Arguments: {"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"text":{"maxLength":1200,"type":"string"}},"required":["text"],"type":"object"}
